of twenty thousand five hundred dollars a

291
00:10:30,942 --> 00:10:33,057
year and one hundred thousand dollars in

292
00:10:33,057 --> 00:10:34,080
total.

293
00:10:34,180 --> 00:10:36,390
Parents face new limits too.

294
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:39,111
And a new Repayment Assistance Plan takes

295
00:10:39,111 --> 00:10:41,754
effect by July twenty twenty-six.

296
00:10:42,017 --> 00:10:44,487
Let me put the business together.

297
00:10:44,667 --> 00:10:46,767
Colleges set the price.

298
00:10:46,807 --> 00:10:48,070
The government lends,

299
00:10:48,070 --> 00:10:50,597
and ended up carrying the losses.

300
00:10:50,667 --> 00:10:52,055
Servicers collect,

301
00:10:52,055 --> 00:10:54,067
paid by the borrower.

302
00:10:54,327 --> 00:10:56,550
And the borrowers carry the debt for

303
00:10:56,550 --> 00:10:57,817
decades.

304
00:10:57,937 --> 00:10:59,837
The new limits cap how much flows

305
00:10:59,837 --> 00:11:01,387
in at the top.

306
00:11:01,657 --> 00:11:03,877
Whether that pushes colleges to cut

307
00:11:03,877 --> 00:11:04,521
prices,

308
00:11:04,521 --> 00:11:07,163
or pushes students toward private lenders,

309
00:11:07,163 --> 00:11:09,761
is the question of the next decade.

310
00:11:10,017 --> 00:11:13,218
So what is the business behind America's

311
00:11:13,218 --> 00:11:14,557
student debt?

312
00:11:14,747 --> 00:11:17,607
It was built on a simple promise.

313
00:11:17,697 --> 00:11:19,127
Borrow today,

314
00:11:19,127 --> 00:11:21,187
earn more tomorrow.

315
00:11:21,567 --> 00:11:23,042
For many graduates,

316
00:11:23,042 --> 00:11:24,497
that promise holds.

317
00:11:24,717 --> 00:11:26,857
But the bill has quietly been split

318
00:11:26,857 --> 00:11:28,168
between students,

319
00:11:28,168 --> 00:11:29,211
their parents,

320
00:11:29,211 --> 00:11:30,254
and taxpayers,

321
00:11:30,254 --> 00:11:32,929
while the money for the degree was

322
00:11:32,929 --> 00:11:34,599
paid on day one.

323
00:11:34,850 --> 00:11:37,044
Next time on The Hidden Economics,

324
00:11:37,044 --> 00:11:39,660
we follow the money behind another hidden

325
00:11:39,660 --> 00:11:41,870
link of the world economy.

326
00:11:42,020 --> 00:11:44,235
This is The Hidden Economics.
